OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with sunny spells. The
OL,7,Fnight will continue dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods but becoming generally
OL,9,Fcloudier in the west later on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FAfter a mainly dry and bright
OL,12,Fstart to the morning cloud will spread
OL,13,Feast from the afternoon with rain
OL,14,Ffollowing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
